    {
      "sectionId": "section-warlock-cantrip-options",
      "parentSectionId": "section-spell-sniper-spell-options",
      "heading": "Warlock Cantrip Options",
      "sourceAnchor": "warlock-cantrip-options",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-warlock-cantrip-options-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Eldritch Blast. I could go further, but honestly that’s all that there is to\n\tsay. Put Eldritch Blast on your bard or sorcerer."
            }
