              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": Too situational to justify taking this over a more reliable high-damage\n\t\tcantrip."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Eldritch Blast"
              },
              {
                "type": "link",
                "text": "PHB",
                "href": "https://rpgbot.net/dnd5/abbreviations/"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": The definitive reason to take Spell Sniper. Good range, good damage,\n\t\tmultiple attacks, and basically nothing resists Force Damage."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Green-Flame Blade"
              },
              {
                "type": "link",
                "text": "SCAG / TCoE",
                "href": "https://rpgbot.net/dnd5/abbreviations/"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": Why would you take Spell Sniper to take a melee cantrip?"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Magic Stone"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": I honestly have no idea if\n\t\tthis qualifies, but I think that it would because it doesn’t actually do\n\t\tanything interesting unless an attack is made. Even if it does, it’s not a\n\t\tgood choice."
              }
            ]
          ],
